OL,3,AOne killed, 11 injured in second Houthi
OL,4,Astrike on Riyadh airport in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes a day after a strike on the
OL,7,Fsame airport killed 13 people and
OL,8,Finjured 308 others. There have been a
OL,9,Fseries of other attacks earlier in the
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FThe Houthis in Yemen said they were
OL,13,Fbehind them and warned airlines and
OL,14,Fpassengers against using Saudi Arabian
OL,15,Fairports and airspace.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
